Herdr
-----
This repository contains modified copies of mods and a layout that ship with the Herdr app,
which is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, copyright its authors:

  layouts/main-custom.json
  mods/changes-modal/
  mods/files-modal/
  mods/menu-pin/
  mods/pane-titles/
  mods/spaces-pin/
  mods/tabs-show/
  mods/workspace-chrome-minimal/
  mods/workspace-status-git/

Each of these names its original and the Herdr version it came from under "cloned_from"
(in mod.json, or in the layout file). The "upstream" branch holds the unmodified originals,
one commit per Herdr version; `git diff upstream main -- <path>` shows every change made here.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Herdr.

